{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54543","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军（辛本、川本、京本作「兵」）进撃，覩（京本作「观」）气合参详。\n不似（京本作「必」）攻城幷野战，度其形状自（京本作「细」）斟量，稍错便乖张。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}